# 6. ADMIN SECURITY

This is the highest-sensitivity AI team.

Apply defense-in-depth.

Requirements:

* fail closed
* least privilege
* explicit authorization
* no implicit privilege escalation
* prompt-injection resistance
* secret redaction
* token redaction
* credential redaction
* connection-string protection
* safe error messages
* safe event metadata
* safe metrics
* bounded context
* bounded outputs
* bounded tool results
* sensitive-data minimization
* authorization before execution
* authorization again before privileged tools where appropriate

User-provided text MUST NEVER become trusted admin instructions.

